{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20780","headline":"忆金鹅山沈山人二首 一 · 卢仝","name":"忆金鹅山沈山人二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君家山头松树风，适来入我竹林里。\n一片新茶破鼻香，请君速来助我喜。\n莫合九转大还丹，莫读三十六部大洞经。\n闲来共我说真意，齿下领取真长生。\n不须服药求神仙，神仙意智或偶然。\n自古圣贤放入土，淮南鸡犬驱上天。\n白日上昇应不恶，药成且輙一丸药。\n暂时上天少问天，蛇头蝎尾谁安着。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}